### Run the app first:  ./mvnw -f topics/pom.xml -pl 08-rest-api/practical/spring-rest-products spring-boot:run
### Then click "Send request" in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code (REST Client extension).

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Create (201 + Location + ETag)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Laptop", "category": "tech", "price": 999.50, "stock": 5}

### Create another
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Coffee mug", "category": "home", "price": 7.25, "stock": 40}

### Validation error (400 Problem Details with field errors)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "category": "tech", "price": -1}

### Duplicate name (409)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "laptop", "category": "tech", "price": 1}

### List: filter, sort, paginate
GET {{base}}?category=tech&sort=price,desc&page=0&size=5

### Get one (note the ETag header)
GET {{base}}/1

### Replace with the current ETag (200, ETag becomes "2")
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"name": "Laptop Pro", "category": "tech", "price": 1299, "stock": 3}

### Replace with a stale ETag (412 Precondition Failed)
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"name": "Laptop Old", "category": "tech", "price": 10, "stock": 1}

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock": 10}

### Delete (204), then GET gives 404
DELETE {{base}}/2

### Unsupported media type (415 as Problem Details)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
